    "<p class=\"prose\"> Every story is repeatadly rated by all 3 judges (instead of the human raters, where only the human stories had a suffiencent number for IRR-calculation). Each (prompt set x author x item) combination was independently rated by Claude, GPT, and Gemini as judges.</p>\n",
